From: Nexo Consolidator <nexo@nexus.local>
Date: Sun, 10 May 2026 05:44:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: property inventory + REST API layer

- Added migration 000002: properties, room_types, rooms, rate_plans, daily_rates
  with RLS policies, triggers, indexes
- Domain models: Property, RoomType, Room, RatePlan, DailyRate
  with state machines (Assign, Vacate, SetMaintenance)
- Repositories: PostgresPropertyRepository, PostgresRoomTypeRepository, PostgresRoomRepository
  with tenant isolation, optimistic locking, metrics
- REST API (chi router) implementing OpenAPI spec endpoints:
  GET/POST /tenants/{id}/guests, /reservations
  POST /reservations/{id}/checkin, /checkout, PATCH /cancel
  GET/POST /tenants/{id}/properties
  GET/POST /properties/{id}/room-types, /rooms
  PATCH /rooms/{id}/status, /housekeeping
  GET /tenants/{id}/availability (with date-range overlap query)
- Room assignment engine: check-in assigns room (status -> occupied),
  check-out vacates (status -> available, housekeeping -> dirty)
- Added chi/v5 to go.mod (run 'go mod tidy' locally to resolve)
- Wired chi router into main.go replacing bare ServeMux
